# Source artwork that is a base64-encoded raster wrapped in an <svg> element.
# These files are 13-37 MB each and contain no vector data — the entire weight
# is an embedded PNG. Every one of them is a 1:1 source for a much smaller
# optimised WebP next to it, and that WebP is what the page actually loads.
# Keeping the .svg out of git stops ~175 MB of blobs being committed; the
# originals still live in the working tree and in public/ for anyone who needs
# to re-derive the optimised version.
